{
  "slug": "scriptify",
  "name": "Scriptify",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Turn LLM instructions (skills, plugins, prompts) into standalone, deterministic scripts — more reliable than agent calls, with no token cost and faster execution.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `audit` (Audit a project for LLM instructions that could be turned into standalone scripts), `generate` (Generate a standalone script from an audit report item or a natural-language instruction), `verify` (Verify that generated scripts correctly replicate the behaviour of the original LLM instructions they replace)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install scriptify@claude-community` from `ygongdev/scriptify`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
